# steps/free-names.md (class B): k is -1 in the caller, so big's conversion int -> size_t of the free name refuses --
# big's implicit throw `convert`, taken by go's `catch: convert ()` like any implicit name (unit_s4_ret_conv_catch).
fn: big () size_t
    return: k
fn: go () int
    int: k -1
    int: r 3
    size_t: got 0U
    got: big()
    catch: convert ()
        r: 7
    return: r

sendMessage: exit(exit_code: go(); stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
